From 6f9b737370854803da74c324afbd7b4cbb42f855 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: moWerk <mo@mowerk.net>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 02:45:15 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] camerabin: small viewfinder with libcamerasrc, photo at full
 size, Release 15
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

wrappercamerabinsrc has one source stream, so camerabin ran the photo
viewfinder at the image resolution (3200x1800 in jolla-camera): about
10 fps, and the autofocus sampled as slowly. libcamerasrc renegotiates
by restarting the camera in the same sensor mode, so with it the
viewfinder keeps the size the application asked for and only the
captured frame comes at the image resolution (wrappercamerabinsrc
captures the first buffer after the switch; the IPA keeps exposure and
focus over it). QT_GSTREAMER_LIBCAMERA_FULL_VIEWFINDER=1 restores the
old behaviour.

Disclosure: LLMGD-0 · origin O1 (author chose a small viewfinder with a switch at the shutter, the model wrote the change; not yet run on the device)
LLMGD: v0.3; assurance=A0; flags=none; origin=O1; origin_headline=O1; scope=qtmultimedia; graded-by=model; retrieval=none
---
 rpm/qtmultimedia.spec                                |  2 +-
 src/plugins/gstreamer/camerabin/camerabinsession.cpp | 10 +++++++++-
 2 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/rpm/qtmultimedia.spec b/rpm/qtmultimedia.spec
index 6ff5ef81..b88b77c8 100644
--- a/rpm/qtmultimedia.spec
+++ b/rpm/qtmultimedia.spec
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 Name:       qt5-qtmultimedia
 Summary:    Qt Multimedia module
 Version:    5.6.2+v4l.20261024000000.qx1050
-Release:    14%{?dist}
+Release:    15%{?dist}
 License:    (LGPLv2 or LGPLv3) with exception or GPLv3 or Qt Commercial
 URL:        https://www.qt.io/
 Source0:    %{name}-%{version}.tar.bz2
diff --git a/src/plugins/gstreamer/camerabin/camerabinsession.cpp b/src/plugins/gstreamer/camerabin/camerabinsession.cpp
index a3f2ea69..aff8f731 100644
--- a/src/plugins/gstreamer/camerabin/camerabinsession.cpp
+++ b/src/plugins/gstreamer/camerabin/camerabinsession.cpp
@@ -349,7 +349,15 @@ void CameraBinSession::setupCaptureResolution()
     // If capture resolution is specified, use it also for the viewfinder to avoid caps negotiation
     // to fail.
     if (m_usingWrapperCameraBinSrc) {
-        if (m_captureMode == QCamera::CaptureStillImage && !imageResolution.isEmpty())
+        // libcamerasrc renegotiates by restarting the camera in the same sensor mode, so
+        // the viewfinder can stay small (smooth, faster autofocus) and only the captured
+        // frame comes at the image resolution. QT_GSTREAMER_LIBCAMERA_FULL_VIEWFINDER=1
+        // keeps the viewfinder at the image resolution.
+        static const bool fullViewfinder = qgetenv("QT_GSTREAMER_LIBCAMERA_FULL_VIEWFINDER") == "1";
+        const bool smallViewfinder = libcameraSource() && !fullViewfinder
+                && !viewfinderResolution.isEmpty();
+        if (m_captureMode == QCamera::CaptureStillImage && !imageResolution.isEmpty()
+                && !smallViewfinder)
             viewfinderResolution = imageResolution;
         else if (m_captureMode == QCamera::CaptureVideo && !videoResolution.isEmpty())
             viewfinderResolution = videoResolution;
